00:01:32.550 --> 00:01:37.400
from a shared inventory pool between marketplaces for SKUs you can fulfill yourself.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:42.000
We do not currently support connecting fulfillment by Amazon inventory across marketplaces.

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.110
You can, however, list FBA inventory separately in Amazon.

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:47.023
com, Amazon.

00:01:47.023 --> 00:01:48.393
