com.

00:01:53.375 --> 00:01:56.180
MX, you can customize your own pricing strategy.

00:01:56.180 --> 00:02:05.680
All offers will be converted to local currency at the time of creation.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:11.700
Canada listings will be posted in Canadian dollars and Mexico listings in Mexico pesos.

00:02:11.700 --> 00:02:13.884
First, you'll need to pick the U.

00:02:13.884 --> 00:02:14.052
S.

00:02:14.052 --> 00:02:16.740
