00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:26.464
You'll have four options for pricing those listings.

00:02:26.464 --> 00:02:31.860
The same price as your source marketplace, a percentage above the source marketplace price,

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:37.822
a percentage below the source marketplace price, or a fixed amount above the source marketplace

00:02:37.822 --> 00:02:38.220
price.

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:44.417
Remember, currency conversion is already factored in, so these options are for additional price

00:02:44.417 --> 00:02:44.860
