00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:50.980
Click Save All to apply your changes.

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:55.523
Amazon does not require price parity or equal pricing on its platforms in North America,

00:02:55.523 --> 00:02:59.157
so you do not have to price the same way for Amazon.

00:02:59.157 --> 00:03:01.460
