00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:53.196
If you're using fulfillment by Amazon, you'll need to manage your inventory quantities separately

00:03:53.196 --> 00:03:58.180
across each website and customize the SKU used for that ASIN in each marketplace.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:06.558
An easy solution is to add a dash CA or a dash MX to your existing SKU before uploading

